@startuml
!include _style.iuml
|Artisan|
start
:Offer accepted;
if (Either side cancels
before work starts?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Request CANCELLED
  with the reason,
  other party notified;
  |Customer|
  :Optionally repost
  without that artisan;
  stop
else (no)
endif
|Artisan|
:Mark ON_THE_WAY
(directions in the
maps app);
:Mark WORKING
(price may change);
:Mark COMPLETED
(automatic after 48 h);
fork
  |Customer|
  :Rate the artisan;
fork again
  |Artisan|
  :Rate the customer;
end fork
|System|
:Recount the artisan's
rating and jobs; award
the featured badge;
stop
@enduml
